# Local overrides for wrangler's `vars`. Copy to `.dev.vars`, which is
# gitignored. Read by `astro dev` and by `astro preview`.

# wrangler.jsonc pins EMDASH_SITE_URL to the production origin so outbound
# links (magic-link login, recovery mail) survive a deploy. `nodejs_compat`
# puts `vars` on process.env, so a local server reads that pin too and derives
# the passkey relying-party ID from it -- which a browser then refuses, because
# an RP ID has to match the origin the page is served from.
#
# Set it to the local origin to register and use passkeys in dev.
EMDASH_SITE_URL="http://localhost:4321"
